  "legacy_defects": [
    "retire, dissolve and rescind interrupt the target before the lock; an agent-actor rescind and an agent-actor self-retire with live reports are refused after that interrupt",
    "delete takes no pre-archive interrupt: a running turn of a deleted seat is not stopped before its records and scratch directory go",
    "the operator door's rename reaps and broadcasts hub_changed, the agent door's rename does neither",
    "a rehire's waiting-mail drive uses a different wording and ping_reason on the two doors"
  ],
  "scope": "Legacy boundary of the operator ops door's remaining operations and its preview (P01 F1b) on disposable SQLite. The provider gate, turn delivery, the pre-archive interrupt, the remote reap, the transcript copy, forget and the broadcasts are spies; the door, the ledger, the preview, save and reload are real. Legacy conformance evidence only: not a runtime census, not PostgreSQL or Rust qualification."
